{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1050361-wisdom-degeneration","id":1050361,"title":"Wisdom Degeneration.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-02-17T01:09:03-08:00","id":1050361,"title":"Wisdom Degeneration.","content":"Since examples in the book are a bit lacking, I was hoping to see what kind of actions would make a character for Wisdom Degeneration at Enlightened/Understanding/Falling Wisdom. Maybe anyone can site an example from your games?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12979-one-dawn","name":"One Dawn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T02:42:44-08:00","id":1050389,"title":"","content":"My character in a game wished to know the intelligence level of some automatons that the dm had created. He attempted to read them with Mind magic to find out. They had mental defenses, so he was unable to get the answer he wanted. When my character persisted, the dm had the lead automaton ask my character what he wished to know. I responded out of character by saying that he didn't WANT to talk to the...creatures. The dm ruled it as a sin against enlightned wisdom, but my character has a wisdom of 7, so it didn't affect him.<br /> <br /> Later on in the story we had to fight against a Wraith, a summoned demon of Pandemonium. We killed it outside of it's summoning circle, causing it to fall into the Abyss. That is a sin against falling wisdom, thus we had to make a degeneration check. Luckily we all passed.<br /> <br /> Honestly, there are plenty of threads already on this website discussing Wisdom. You should look them up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7825-falcon777","name":"Falcon777","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-17T09:12:45-08:00","id":1050534,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/897632-2e-fan-guidelines-for-acts-of-hubris\">Some Guidelines and examples Acts of Hubris</a> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}